+# HNP4: the next arrival deposits a reusable contact and matched self-return is zero
+
+**Date:** 2026-09-05, local apparatus date. **Status:** HNP4 partial native binding and application return.
+
+## Actual binding
+
+[definition] The new `tied-next-arrival` profile uses the actual shared coefficient population
+which occurs both at an entering Lookup and the terminal Contract. In its declared Euclidean
+chart, row `w_a` is the return of address face `a` through that coefficient map's adjoint.
+For the actual former emitted face `p`, causally next received address `a`, and retained
+contextual carrier `h`, the current is `r = w_a-w_p` and its joined field is `h+r`.
+This is a specific constitutive chart, not a derivation of a physical metric/admittance from
+widths. The Lookup's complete scaled operation and the later nonlinear output reactions are
+not silently identified with the unscaled shared coefficient map.
+
+[proved-derived; formal-checked] `HolonicOrientedSiteTransport.TiedMapNextArrival` retains a
+nonempty source word and the exact entering-word equation `source ++ a :: remainder`. It proves
+that `a` is the first new address, the paired-current identity
+`dot(r,h+r)=dot(r,h)+||r||²`, matched-current zero, matched passive identity, and calibration
+of this joined field by `PassiveContact`. Equal widths do not determine the current. These
+theorems do not guarantee a changed winning face, useful generalization, physical energy
+conservation, or correctness of the whole Rust/CUDA implementation.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] `operative_boundary_contact.rs` binds that comparison
+to the session's actual retained emission, contextual carrier, next input and shared resident
+coefficient rows. Neither an application-supplied desired logit nor an internal Add effect
+chooses it. Missing coefficient material refuses instead of using a zero complement. A matched
+face, or an exact zero resident contrast, deposits nothing. The new contact keeps its actual
+source and arrived sections, applies after the existing contact word, and stays with the same
+move-owned session. No learning-rate parameter is used in this chart.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] The learned word acts at the tied-input port, not at
+every internal node. One resident passage applies its ordered maps, including the declared
+midpoint successor projection after each map. A founding row is reused immutably across later
+query rows. The pre-contact numerical carrier returns to the existing reuse owner; it is never
+confused with the contemporary post-contact field. The complete later nonlinear terminal
+operation still emits the answer. The CUDA projection is not the full conserved-axis lift.
+
+[definition] Nonextending words do not invent a matching continuation fibre. This boundary
+specialization does not replace HNP0's generic local-current contract or establish all model
+families. Existing prefix and observed-passage profiles keep their wire meanings and bounded
+results. Another saved cultivation profile cannot silently be combined with this one while
+omitting its adjoint. Broad SKE inherited correspondence is not inferred from broader native input.
+
+## Public operation and rest
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact] `HnaModel::from_native_rest_with_boundary_contact`
+constructs the new profile over admitted native material. The normal public session operation
+returns its successor; `anatomy` reports contact maps separately from linear overlay rank.
+The full session rest uses a new inner v2 wire/header only when this profile is present.
+It preserves source/arrived fields, ordered receipts, last face, last return, native carriers,
+chronology, input context and numerical reuse. Old v1 native rests retain their bytes and meaning.
+Missing profile data, incompatible schemas, malformed sections and stale completed faces refuse.
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact] The text adapter delivers each newly received codec
+address in order for this chart, including all of a multi-address followup. It resumes from the
+actual retained input prefix and updates its generation after each successful native occurrence.
+Already-complete equal words still enact a new occurrence. `HnaTextStep.native_occurrences`
+discloses this application work; it is not an epoch or learning target. Other profiles retain
+their earlier one-word application behavior. The codeword stream is independent of file/transport
+packet sizes. The underlying general `advance_native` still advances one declared occurrence.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] Fresh native-base construction now hashes its source
+once and consumes that same rewound file handle. Existing dependency/checkpoint loads retain
+their full verification. No mtime cache, checksum registry or semantic identity was introduced.
+
+## Returned document experiment
+
+[established-bounded; measured] `boundary_contact_hnp4` read the 18-byte UTF-8 document
+`The cube is blue.\n` from `.local/artifacts/hnp4/received-cube.txt`, encoded it once, and exposed
+its six addresses in causal order. Five received contrasts founded five maps. For the identical
+probe `What color is the cube?`, all 262,144 terminal intervals changed; the first selected
+face remained `I`. This establishes a numerical effect at that receiver, not useful fact transfer.
+
+[established-bounded; measured] The active, non-observer model then emitted 20 addresses,
+including native completion marker 106, reaching generation 35,700. Every actual matched
+self-return returned zero and the five maps remained. No carrier refusal or numeric-limit
+increase occurred. Its complete output was:
+
+> I need an image or a description of the cube to tell you what color it is! 😊
+
+[counterexample; measured] This trial did **not** recover the document's color in the new
+question. Coherent termination and nonzero changed transport do not establish useful document
+learning. This result does not close HNP4 or supply HNP5's useful-model evaluation.
+
+[established-bounded; measured] The run took 283,188 ms including cold construction, live input
+acquisition, native operations and persistence. It saved `developed.hna` (five maps, generation
+8,925), then `model.hna`, `text.json` and `result.json` under
+`.local/artifacts/hnp4/boundary-contact-01/`. The final accounted numerical reuse high-water was
+2,092,859,392 bytes, not a measurement of whole-process/GPU peak. The run preceded the fresh-base
+single-scan improvement, so its duration does not measure that improvement.
